      "message": "Question: any specific examples of code paths that may trigger qi_submit_sync() with type !\u003d QI_IEC_TYPE while translation is disabled?\n\nAsking because I\u0027m wondering why exactly it is ok to just silently ignore such submit requests, without any WARN_ON or even returning an error.",
